'''Queen B''' (森の蜜子, ''Mori no Mitsuko'', '''Mitsuko of the Forest''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy introduced in the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Honey Trap (Deadly)|Honey Trap]]. She was added in [[Version 5.4 Update|Version 5.4]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], she was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

